  "releaseNotes": "v0.9.0: Embedded TR catalog correction — the t1102 entry had 93 mislabeled OutBlock field descriptions (broker 매수/매도 s*/d* swapped; abscnt/vol/jkrate/exhratio wrong concepts; bf* quarterly figures labeled 당기/전기 instead of 전분기/전전분기; 외국계 buy/sell fields), all verified against the official t1102 spec and fixed so ls_describe_tr reports them accurately. Lockstep version bump with RedoxNet.Mcp.LsOpenApi 0.9.0. See https://github.com/redoxnet/mcp-lsopenapi/blob/main/RELEASENOTES.Core.md for full notes.",
